  "notes": [
    "These research actions describe root TARGET010 only, independently of Claude PLAN05 receive experiments.",
    "Alias calls are separate from allowed-class candidate sets; runtime binding, execution, precedence and acceptance unobserved.",
    "MACore null decoder returns emptyMapping without reading coder attributes; native creation can return nil.",
    "MACore constant bodies do not establish effective Logic getters; LogicAdditions has its own destination implementation.",
    "finishDecoding_ma samples error before finishDecoding, not after; getter ignores BOOL and conditionally caches decode value first.",
    "Unresolved indirect tail at once body and full native failure/exception/cleanup remain open.",
    "No cache-free round trip, saved reload, restoration, Undo or runtime mapping semantics validation.",
    "Relative metadata and raw chained fixup words are verified separately from decompiler type guesses/resolved imports."
  ]
